        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>ABH 0340 Center Hung Top Pivot Hinge</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis heavy duty center hung top pivot hinge is engineered for durability on heavy doors up to 500 lbs.  These are used standard with <a href=\"/products/heavy-door-center-hung-pivot-set-abh-0370\"><b>ABH 0370 Door Pivot Set</b></a>.  <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=519415\"><b>ABH Door Pivots</b></a> are Made in the USA to insure high quality. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-0340-pivot_size.gif?v=1704354734\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ABH 0340 Center Hung Top Pivot Hinge Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSet includes heavy duty top pivot, dress plate for jamb portion of door and installation hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for ABH 0340 Top Door Pivot\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Weight: Up to 500 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Door Arm Length: 5-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Arm Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Full Mortise, Center Hung</li>\r\n<li>Walking beam type hinge</li>\r\n<li>Dress plate provided for jamb portion</li>\r\n<li><b>Non-Handed, Reversible </b></li>\r\n<li>BHMA/ANSI C06213/3520 (modified)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/0340-template.pdf?v=1691093120\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH 0340 Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. <br>\r\n**Top Door Pivot Only. <b>\r\n</p>",
